msgid ""
"There is no requirement that template strings are processed in any "
"particular way. Code that processes templates has no obligation to return a "
"string. Template strings are a flexible, general-purpose feature."
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0750.rst:287
msgid ""
"See the `Common Patterns Seen in Processing Templates`_ section for more "
"information on how to process template strings. See the `Examples`_ section "
